ent-6991520465\n\n**Failed investigation; the fixed pair is not admissible.** The source-head software checks and hosted CI #580 passed. The pair then ran once in the pinned optional runtime and failed before the validated-share child. Its ordinary child completed two seven-loader archives, three reads, 432 profiles, 1,152 conditions and three native workers, then hit a source gate that compares profile and condition *lists* with integer counts. The [19-member raw failure](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/results/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/failed-pair/manifest.json) at `9372a1c` and [data-only report](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/research/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight/docs/validated-sharing-runtime-preflight-result.md) at `2066f2c` preserve the outcome. No retry or identity/savings claim.\n\n**New hosted evidence defect found in CI #583:** the 34-member source-check manifest published at `c5697ef` listed a generated `local/__pycache__/verify-local.py.cpython-313.pyc`, but Git ignored that file. It was present in the local checkout and absent from a normal clone. The report tests passed locally but hosted Python 3.11 failed four report cases while authenticating that missing member; Python 3.12 is still running. This means the source-check archive was not fully public before the pair, despite the prior checkpoint claim and the raw manifest flag. The pair cannot satisfy its preregistered publication gate. I am retaining both official failures and will publish a transparent archive repair and corrected report; the historical pair and manifests will not be rewritten.\n\nCurrent state: PR remains draft. Earlier PR #92 missing-Numba, forecast, accuracy and full-context-copy failures remain failed. No strategy or admission change.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-18T21:03:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:12:40Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,